msgid "Sharing with this group is not allowed."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hidden groups"
msgstr ""

msgid "Keep groups that are only meant for configuration out of sharing"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Some groups are only meant for configuration, such as enabling an app for "
"everyone, and are far too large to share with.\n"
"\n"
"Admins can hide such groups in the sharing settings. Nobody can share files "
"or folders with a hidden group, and hidden groups do not show up in sharing "
"suggestions. Existing shares with a hidden group keep working, but cannot "
"get more permissions."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hidden groups saved"
msgstr ""

msgid "Failed to save the hidden groups"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Nobody can share files or folders with these groups, and they do not show up "
"in suggestions, for example in the share dialog. Use this for large groups "
"that are only meant for configuration, such as enabling an app for everyone. "
"Existing shares keep working, but cannot get more permissions. Calendars, "
"address books and teams that contain such a group are not covered."
msgstr ""

msgid "Groups that nobody can share with"
msgstr ""
